hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2722","Narrated to us by Abu Bisr al-Wasiti, who said: Narrated to us by Khalid, meaning Ibn Abdullah, from Khalid al-Hadda', from Ikrimah, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: \The Prophet (ﷺ) circumambulated the House while riding on a camel. Whenever he reached the Corner (the Black Stone)"," he would point towards it with something in his hand and say 'Allahu Akbar' (God is the Greatest).\"""""
